    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="b1503791-9fc3-51e1-aa27-9a690610b06a" activityNameId="6c2137cd-0031-53ae-a1ec-096ec94433f0" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Logs, mixed, burned in wood heater 6kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Logs, mixed, burned in wood heater 6kW
Inventory refers to the combustion of wood logs in a 6 kW wood heater with 1000 operating hours per year. The lower heating value is 18.0 MJ/kg dry matter. Air emission factors are calculated from the weighted average of measurements of log stoves;
UUID: e2329c92-2183-3174-b1ae-730a027658a7
Included are the infrastructure, the wood requirements , the emissions to air, the transport of the fuel, the electricity needed for operation, and the disposal of the ashes.
Location: Could be used for central European conditions
Technology: Boiler of average technology available on market
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e2329c92-2183-3174-b1ae-730a027658a7.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
